{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"No new hard calendar deadline is evidenced. If Docker/CVE or Windows signing stay red, v1.0.0 remains blocked until both clear—there is no documented “ship anyway by date” exception.\n\nSo the earlier security-gate hold is unchanged, not superseded: both T005 and T029 remain mandatory release gates. [SRC-CU-CIPH-21] The pre-release audit also explicitly says release does not open with unresolved Docker or Windows holds. [SRC-MEET-10]"}}
